  m_text: "<size=20>\n- Free Games may be triggered in stage 2 or above when the\n
    \  user beats the Goblin.\n\n- During Free Games, if Wild symbol appears in a
    full stack\n   on any reel, award a random Wild multiplier (2x, 3x, 5x) \n   to
    that reel.\n\n- The Goblin symbol is removed during Free Games."
