  m_text: "<size=20>\n- Sub-symbol appears on random symbols in stage\n   3 only.\r\n\n-
    All sub-symbols  are collected towards the Chest\n   Bonus meter.\r\n\n- When
    enough sub-symbols are collected, the Chest\n   Bonus is triggered. \r\n\n- When
    triggered, chest or additional free spin \n   symbols appear.\r\n\n- Chest symbols
    award credit, mini, minor, major or\n   grand jackpot."
